# Variadic param collects excess positional args into a Dict (at runtime).
# The variadic param type is Seq(T) where T is inferred from the supplied args.
# Grammar forbids @annotation on variadic params. param_types[i] and the env binding
# are both set to Seq(fresh TypeVar) for type inference.
# At runtime, excess positional args are collected into an int-keyed Dict.
# The type/runtime mismatch (Seq vs Dict) is allowed in gradual typing.
[f: [fn [x ...rest] rest]
 result: [f 10 20 30]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(x, rest), "result": Dict({0: Int(20), 1: Int(30)})})
